e save slots join the demo, alongside improved Softling animations, skill descriptions, visuals and sound.Hello, everyone!Thank you for helping us shape this little field since the demo launched. Your reports of blurry plants, confusing skill descriptions, Softlings getting stuck at the edges, and issues with the story and interface have guided these changes.This","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T09:50:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929013","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5191020-1844751498220568","game_id":"steam-5191020","kind":"announcement","title":"Grass Cutting Game Demo Is Out Now! 🌱","summary":"Hello, everyone!The Grass Cutting Game demo is now available to download for free on Steam. Welcome to a little garden that starts with a single patch of grass!Start with a little grass. Grow a lively garden.Harvest plants to earn coins, unlock new plants and skills, and recruit Softling companions with their own special talents. Start by swinging the sickle yourself, then watch your helpers bustle about as your little patch of grass grows into a busy garden.Discover chives that regrow for chain","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T08:00:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220568","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5191020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:15Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:14Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5191020":"2026-10-26T09:28:15Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5191020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:14Z","status":"